    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="12">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:VIAtr">VI Atr</ref> 12</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">⁊ æfre ne geweorðe þæt Christene man gewifige in VI manna sibfæce on his agenum cynne, þæt is binnan þam feorþan cneowe, ne on þæs lafe þe swa neah wære on woroldcundre sibbe, ne on þæs wifes nydmagan þe he ær hæfde.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">And it must never happen that a Christian man marries among his own kin within six degrees of relationship, that is, within the fourth generation, or with the widow of a man as nearly related to him as this, or with a near relative of his first wife's.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">[Not in D]</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
